&lt;p&gt;In February 2021 I tweeted to a daunting &amp;gt;20k followers by curating for &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/WeAreRLadies" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;code&gt;@WeAreLadies&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; on Twitter. This was great opportunity to share knowledge, interact with others, and learn something in return, ultimately cultivating new connections and collaborations. From preparation to fruition, I hope this post helps you confidently enroll as a curator!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>